  "title": "1.130.0",
  "summary": "What's Changed Restore version to v1.130.0 by @mozzius in #11314 Show a non-standard OTA channel notice in the drawer by @mozzius in #11288 Bump slackapi/slack-github-action from 3.0.5 to 4.0.0 by @dependabot [bot] in #11307 Fix caret misplaced upon pressing Return when using Japanese symbols … by @abulenok in #11316 Drop react-native-progress fork by @mozz…",
  "content": "<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restore version to v1.130.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11314\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11314</a></li>\n<li>Show a non-standard OTA channel notice in the drawer by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11288\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11288</a></li>\n<li>Bump slackapi/slack-github-action from 3.0.5 to 4.0.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11307\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11307</a></li>\n<li>Fix caret misplaced upon pressing Return when using Japanese symbols … by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11316\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11316</a></li>\n<li>Drop <code>react-native-progress</code> fork by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11312\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11312</a></li>\n<li>Enter build numbers manually for production OTA deploys by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11289\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11289</a></li>\n<li>Add TIDA form URL for adult content report by <a href=\"https://github.com/foysalit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@foysalit</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11150\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11150</a></li>\n<li>APP-2670: add multipart video upload transport by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11222\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11222</a></li>\n<li>Get trending section indices from GrowthBook by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11319\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11319</a></li>\n<li>Let trending topic names wrap to two lines by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11323\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11323</a></li>\n<li>Update empty state for starter pack search by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11325\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11325</a></li>\n<li>Use debugOptimized variant for Android dev by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11302\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11302</a></li>\n<li>Indicate if someone followed you via a starter pack by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11320</a></li>\n<li>Fix peek menu crash by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11315\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11315</a></li>\n<li>Get number of trending topics for Explore from GrowthBook by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11324\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11324</a></li>\n<li>Log rank and parent index with trending topic events by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11331\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11331</a></li>\n<li>Add a dialog for debugging feature flags to developer settings by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/10988\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#10988</a></li>\n<li>Fix alt text input field not growing more than 3 lines by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11328\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11328</a></li>\n<li>fix TextInput resizes on Android when the first chat is typed by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11318\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11318</a></li>\n<li>Handle PR OTA version mismatches and failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11330\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11330</a></li>\n<li>Use Spanish for Aragonese <code>intl-displaynames</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/surfdude29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@surfdude29</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11327\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11327</a></li>\n<li>Fix PR OTA deployments reverting after apply by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11338\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11338</a></li>\n<li>Fix profile badge sometimes displayed below on Android by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11337\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11337</a></li>\n<li>Add nicer loading screen while OTA is loading by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/9499\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#9499</a></li>\n<li>Add additional tests for groupNotifications by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11332\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11332</a></li>\n<li>Handle camera cancellation by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11322\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11322</a></li>\n<li>Simplify inline badge presentation, fix alignment by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11352\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11352</a></li>\n<li>Classify report dialog errors by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11354\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11354</a></li>\n<li>Bump the actions group with 6 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11370\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11370</a></li>\n<li>APP-2764: Remove unnecessary top padding on GIF posts by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11321\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11321</a></li>\n<li>Add unique context to ‘People I follow’ in FromDropdown.tsx by <a href=\"https://github.com/smileyhead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@smileyhead</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11275\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11275</a></li>\n<li>Test requiring at least one interest in onboarding by <a href=\"https://github.com/abenzer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abenzer</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11391\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11391</a></li>\n<li>Allow feature-gated 10-minute video uploads by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11388\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11388</a></li>\n<li>APP-2793: harden multipart video uploads by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11366\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11366</a></li>\n<li>Enrich fatal HLS errors in Sentry by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11359\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11359</a></li>\n<li>display backend-driven upload failure messages by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11329\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11329</a></li>\n<li>Add canonical OP thread numbering by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11184\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11184</a></li>\n<li>Show app build numbers in CI summaries by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11267\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11267</a></li>\n<li>Use Claude Opus 5 in GitHub workflows by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11335\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11335</a></li>\n<li>Use toolbox video compressor by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11246\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11246</a></li>\n<li>Tweak strings by <a href=\"https://github.com/surfdude29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@surfdude29</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11407\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11407</a></li>\n<li>increase ci node heap by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11406\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11406</a></li>\n<li>Add repost-only mutes by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11223\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11223</a></li>\n<li>Add timestamp field to video report dialog by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11339\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11339</a></li>\n<li>Fix post numbers being clipped in some cases by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11413\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11413</a></li>\n<li>Fix profile icon on custom feeds by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11408\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11408</a></li>\n<li>Add name and description for beta feature by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11409\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11409</a></li>\n<li>Patch react-native-worklets: fix web scheduleOnUI on errors by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11416\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11416</a></li>\n<li>Fix chat info panel not using square icons for labellers by <a href=\"https://github.com/RetroSunstar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@RetroSunstar</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11415\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11415</a></li>\n<li>Work around reanimated bug in sign up screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11411\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11411</a></li>\n<li>v1.130.0 Release Prep by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11414\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11414</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/compare/1.129.1...1.130.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.129.1...1.130.0</a></p>",
